      "statement": "Account Terraform creates up to three OIDC providers (dev keycloak, optional stage_keycloak, optional prod_keycloak), with the stage and prod providers gated by count on their issuer URL and failing their plan via lifecycle.precondition if their matching client ID or thumbprint is left blank while enabled; the investigation Lambda routes tokens to configured issuer JWKS endpoints and verifies signature, expiration and audience.",
