      "statement": "aws_iam_role.sre_shared's max_session_duration is the configurable oidc_session_duration variable, validated to be between 3600 and 43200 seconds, while aws_iam_role.lambda_invoker's max_session_duration is hard-coded to the AWS minimum of 3600 seconds rather than configurable.",
