    {
      "id": "claim_dc4661a009924ac8849b9e103608ce56",
      "statement": "The Lambda extracts its ABAC session-tag value from the token's https://aws.amazon.com/tags principal_tags claim at a configurable key (ABAC_TAG_KEY); it falls back to the preferred_username claim only when the configured key is the default 'username', and otherwise returns 403 if that principal tag is absent rather than silently substituting a different identity.",
