    {
      "id": "claim_dcf51619b0734e4285bd530f343673c1",
      "statement": "The realm-setup walkthrough's example KeycloakRealmImport configures an audience mapper consistent with the root README's 'aud must match rosa-boundary-sre' requirement, but its example groups (sre-admins/sre-operators/sre-viewers) do not include the 'sre-team' group that the README and the Lambda's default required_groups/REQUIRED_GROUPS configuration expect, so a realm built exactly as documented issues tokens whose groups claim will not satisfy the Lambda's default group check unless the deployer reconciles the group names or REQUIRED_GROUPS value.",
